cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: script
title: "MYOD1-related enhancer nexus analysis"
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-07-28

authors:
  - family-names: Huang
    given-names: Zhi-Jun
    affiliation: Van Andel Institute
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5534-7576"

abstract: >
  R scripts used to identify MYOD1-related loop-chained enhancer
  modules, characterize enhancer nexus connectivity, link enhancer
  modules to gene promoters, and calculate ABC-like regulatory scores
  in WT and SMCHD1-KO cells.

keywords:
  - MYOD1
  - SMCHD1
  - chromatin loops
  - enhancer nexus
  - activity-by-contact
  - gene regulation

repository-code: https://github.com/knight-hzj/published_script
license: MIT
